            <ArticleTitle>Nerve injection injuries.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>27-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Nerve injection injury is preventable. There is now a reasonable basis for management of the unfortunate victims, should an accident occur. Practitioners who follow the basic steps of management will both aid their patients and also allow them to give a better account of themselves in the medicolegal setting.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
